Looking for audio visual rental for press conferences in Malaga? A press conference is not a general corporate conference: it is one speaker at a podium, a PA system that reaches press microphones and recorders, and space for media, not breakout rooms or delegate seating at scale.

Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests that setup across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

Get in touch today and let us help you make your press conference run smoothly.

